2. Go modules
-------------

Seath links Go modules listed in `go.mod` / `go.sum`. They are fetched at build
time and are not vendored into this repository. Their licences are those
published by their upstream projects; run `go list -m all` on a build tree to
enumerate the exact versions in use.


